      <p style="font-size:20px; font-weight:900; color:#111; margin-bottom:6px;">EMI from ₹2,500 / month</p>
      <p style="font-size:13px; color:#6B7280; margin-bottom:6px;">HDFC Bank · SBI · Bajaj Finance · IDFC First</p>
